appears at the point of the wedge,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"indicating a crescendo from nothing or diminuendo to nothing. It is no by default, and used only when the type","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is crescendo, or the type is stop for a wedge that began with a diminuendo type. The line-type is solid if not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"specified.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLWedge"}}}